  "goodToKnow": "Das Durchsetzungsvermögen is the ability to push things through and get your way, in a positive sense. You'll see it constantly in German job adverts, often next to Teamfähigkeit and Belastbarkeit. It is built from sich durchsetzen (to prevail), a linking -s- and das Vermögen, which means both ability and wealth. A person with it is durchsetzungsstark. It is a long word with no plural."
